From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: BiSheng <raft-mobile-bisheng@mail.build>
Date: Tue, 29 Sep 2026 06:17:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] fix(compose): defer lazy offset alignment while a scroll is
 in progress

tryExpandStartSizeNoScroll launched its 150 ms alignment job even while
Compose still owned a settling scroll, so it could fight the fling. Route
it through DeferredScrollOffsetAlignmentCoordinator: skip the alignment
while scrolling (unless forced), retry it on scroll end, re-check after
the OHOS refresh delay, and invalidate pending jobs when a ScrollerView
is reused by a different scroll state.

Fork-Patch: compose-lazy-deferred-offset-alignment
Origin: 14b3a142
Upstream-Status: pending
